{"id":429,"date":"2023-01-25T14:40:04","date_gmt":"2023-01-25T14:40:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/personal-banking\/banking\/lending\/home-loans\/"},"modified":"2023-04-06T13:58:02","modified_gmt":"2023-04-06T13:58:02","slug":"home-loans","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/home-loans\/","title":{"rendered":"Home Loans"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>Mortgages made easy \u2013 as they should be<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Whether you\u2019re looking to buy a first home, purchase a second home, build an addition, construct a new home, or reduce your payments or your term, our team of lenders will provide you with hands-on support, guidance and financing options.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-3 wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"507\" height=\"462\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB-Lending.jpg\" alt=\"A banker in purple hands a pen to a man and woman to sign papers\" class=\"wp-image-4518\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB-Lending.jpg 507w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/PB-Lending-300x273.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 507px) 100vw, 507px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\">\n<h2>Your first step: <br>Pre-approval<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Ensuring that you&#8217;re pre-approved for a mortgage makes the entire home buying process easier, more efficient and faster. Accomplished Realtors will expect a potential borrower to have done their due diligence with a lender if they intend to finance a home purchase. And, sellers have come to expect a serious offer to purchase be accompanied by a pre-approval letter if it is not a cash offer.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>Find out what financing options are available to you and let us help you put your best foot forward with a pre-approval from Nebula Trust Bank! It\u2019s important to know, a pre-approval is a thorough examination of a borrower\u2019s credit, income, liabilities, and assets, which may require supporting documentation be provided to the loan officer. Anything less is simply a pre-qualification and does not offer the same level of confidence to a Realtor or seller.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There is no cost or obligation to obtain a pre-approval from Nebula Trust Bank. So, reach out to a loan officer today and let us help you finance your next home.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Ready to explore your options?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Check out our <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/home-loans\/first-time-home-buyer\/\">First Time Home Buyer products<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/home-loans\/specialty-financing-solutions\/\">Specialty Financing Solutions<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/home-loans\/conventional-loans\/\">Conventional Loans<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/home-loans\/home-equity-loans-lines-of-credit\/\">Home Equity Loans and Lines of Credit<\/a>, and <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/banking\/personal-banking\/lending\/home-loans\/calculators\/\">Calculators<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.mymortgage-online.com\/loan-app\/?siteId=8456065592&amp;lar=mmorrell&amp;workFlowId=23826\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Apply Now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Have questions? Speak with one of our Residential Loan Originators who has been helping customers realize their dreams for a very long time. Call <a href=\"tel:860-448-4174\">860-448-4174<\/a> or <a href=\"mailto:MortgageCenter@chelseagroton.com\">email us<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Questions on an existing mortgage or escrow account? Please check out our\u202f<a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.approvalserver.com\/app\/uploads\/2023\/02\/Understanding_Escrow.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Escrow FAQs<\/a>, or contact our <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.approvalserver.com\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Customer Care Team<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Residential Lending Team<\/h2>\n\n\n<section data-block_14b604789bfff76bc021c17b5fed13b0 class=\"team-member align\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n                      <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <div class=\"team-member-card\">\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/our-team\/marta-amor-baker\/\">\n      <img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Marta-Amor-Baker-WEB.jpg\" class=\"card-img-top wp-post-image\" alt=\"Marta Amor-Baker\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Marta-Amor-Baker-WEB.jpg 400w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Marta-Amor-Baker-WEB-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/01\/Marta-Amor-Baker-WEB-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" \/>\n    <\/a>\n    <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/our-team\/marta-amor-baker\/\" class=\"team-card-title team-member-name\">Marta Amor-Baker<\/a>\n    <p class=\"team-card-text\">AS, Mortgage Specialist<\/p>\n    <a href=\"tel:(860) 448-4879\" class=\"team